unicorn of differing alignment.  But do NOT attempt to sacrifice a gray unicorn
at a neutral altar.  You get zapped big-time, no saving throw.  A black 
unicorn at a neutral altar would be ok, and usually converts it to law on the
spot.  

	alignment of unicorn = alignment of temple    : Instantaneous Death. 
	alignment of unicorn = not yours, not temple  : very good manuver.
	alignment of unicorn = yours, not temple      : you convert to temple.
							(rarely a wise move)


